think THE ROOM QUESTION ANSWERS ITSELF FROM A RULE ALREADY SEATED. design-rooms asks one question -- would this still be worth reading if the code it describes were deleted -- and the signature arithmetic, the enumerate-rather-than-five-rows reasoning, and the grace shown an elder name each outlive the receipt milestone. So active-designing, which already holds this exact shape: the bounded-torus moonshots page ranks twelve proposals and carries four errata correcting its own rankings.
think AND COUNSEL'S CLOSURE RULES ITS OWN REUSE. Closed means no longer growing, never no longer true; a cited piece is LIFTED into its proper room rather than the room being reopened. The design-over-build counsel is already lifted, into lindy-first-crux, which cites it by name -- so it wants obeying rather than re-filing, and reviving the room would be a third copy of one insight.
think THE REAL FRICTION SITS ELSEWHERE AND IT IS MEASURED: 80 living tracked Markdown pages park a decision on Keaton's word, against 44 recording one granted, plus 6 YOURS lines on the card and one Open doors section. A decision can be parked in four places and nothing reads them together. A NEW ROOM WOULD MAKE THAT WORSE by adding an eighty-first place to park one, so the page proposes a READING over the rooms that exist and names it as a proposal rather than building it.
obs I CHECKED FOR THE INSTRUMENT BEFORE PROPOSING IT, which is tonight's own lesson applied. Nothing in tools/ reads pending decisions; the nearest matches are an equinox word-scope guard and some amphora fixtures, neither on this subject.
obs THE SIGNATURE FINDING IS THE ONE WORTH CARRYING. The present 96-byte ceiling already refuses an ordinary Ed25519 signature written in hex at 128, and SLH-DSA-SHAKE-256s -- this tree's own DISC ladder -- signs at 29,792 bytes, roughly seven times the whole 4,096-byte encoded fact. So a post-quantum receipt wants its signature BESIDE the fact rather than inside it, which is a shape question rather than a number, and the page says so rather than burying it in a row.
obs WHAT I LIKE BEST IS NAMED AND IT IS THE STRICTEST ONE: product_digest at exactly 64. It is the only one of the four that makes the product refuse inputs passing today, and a system earns trust by what it declines. The signature row is the one I expect to be revised, and the page says that out loud ahead of time.
